<h2>Professional Summary</h2>
<p class="summary">
Versatile and results-driven <strong>Software Engineer and IT Specialist</strong> with a solid interdisciplinary background spanning software development, enterprise systems administration, network infrastructure, and cybersecurity. Proven track record in developing high-availability academic web systems, streamlining ERP operations (ERPNext, Ibn Al-Haitham, Al-Zahraa), and leading the preliminary handover of enterprise data center facilities. Author of the first documented research on implementing <strong>Zero Trust Architecture</strong> for securing higher education generative AI and e-learning systems. Graduated with <strong>90% (Excellent with Honors)</strong> in Information Systems, and completed a Postgraduate Professional Diploma in Information Security with <strong>84% (Very Good High - جيد جداً مرتفع)</strong>.
</p>

